  "title": "Fruit and Cream Pie II",
  "description": "A large pie with 2 types of fruit and a sour cream topping. Any combination of fruit fillings may be used in this pie. Apple, blueberry, peach or cherries all work well.",
  "authors": [
    "SHASTASPEN"
  ],
